@@@!atrep

@@/ at-org: a syntax mapper for a useful subset of Org-mode.
@@/ Flat headings (stars), org's emphasis family (bold, italic,
@@/ underline, strike), items and definition items, quote and
@@/ verse blocks, pipe tables as stichoi rows, footnotes riding
@@/ the deixis machinery, and line-form links. Code (src,
@@/ example, inline =verbatim=/~code~) maps to the core enlexis
@@/ forms with the language as a genos.

@=== heading-1
@# grammata #@
@"top-level heading (one star); flat, does not nest content"@
===@

@=== heading-2
@## grammata ##@
@"second-level heading (two stars)"@
===@

@=== heading-3
@### grammata ###@
@"third-level heading (three stars)"@
===@

@=== heading-4
@#### grammata ####@
@"fourth-level heading (four stars)"@
===@

@=== heading-5
@##### grammata #####@
@"fifth-level heading (five stars)"@
===@

@=== emphasis
@/ grammata /@
@"italic emphasis (/slashes/)"@
===@

@=== strong
@* grammata *@
@"bold emphasis (*stars*)"@
===@

@=== underline
@_ grammata _@
@"underlined run (_underscores_)"@
===@

@=== strike
@+ grammata +@
@"struck-through run (+pluses+)"@
===@

@=== link
@>< grammata ><@
@"hyperlink target ([[...]]); the grammata is the target"@
===@

@=== blockquote
@>
grammata
>@
@"quote block (#+BEGIN_QUOTE)"@
===@

@=== verse
@~
stichos
~@
@"verse block (#+BEGIN_VERSE); line breaks significant"@
===@

@=== table
@|
stichos
|@
@"pipe table; one row per stichos (cell model pending)"@
===@

@=== unordered-item
@-
grammata
-@
@"bullet list item (- marker); items form flat runs"@
===@

@=== ordered-item
@.(taxis)
grammata
.@
@"enumerated list item (N. marker); items form flat runs"@
===@

@=== definition-item
@:: lemma
grammata
::@
@"description list item (- term :: text); the lemma is the term"@
===@

@=== footnote
@^
grammata
^@
@"footnote definition ([fn:name]); deixis callouts reference it"@
===@
